  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Livelihoods in Fishing Communities in Berbera, Hiis and Maydh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Yovenco will train 100 males in modern fishing techniques in order to increase productivity. This group will be trained in the use of fishing nets, solar lanterns, safety glasses, long lines, echo sound, and GPs packs. The fishers will be able to catch more fish after this training. Yovenco also prepared a market for their product, promising that SOMTONA Factory would take all of their fish.</narrative>
  </description>
